  "description": "Two source plane cases distinguish co-directed and oppositely directed rays on distinct parallel supports; no metric condition on the oblique envelope.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/a07e/lemmadeck/ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/9-10g/figures/fig-62.png",
